discussion.body:
Was looking at [kungfooman/CoD-Bsp-Decompiler](https://github.com/kungfooman/CoD-Bsp-Decompiler) recently
Thought there might be a few structs in there I don't have, and there were.

Brushes are extremely barebones, not unlike `respawn.titanfall`
```c++
struct Brush {
  uint16_t num_sides;
  uint16_t unknown;
};

struct BrushSide {
  union { float distance; uint32_t index; } plane;
  uint32_t texture;
};
```
